      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b04fb" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left"><span class="gradient-text">Questions </span>we're asked about the connected fridge:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b0500-6643cc40" data-w-id="5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b0500" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What is a connected corporate fridge?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A connected corporate fridge is a fridge specially designed for collective catering. Installed in areas where employees can meet and relax (cafeteria, break room, coworking space, etc.), it offers employees self-service, healthy, balanced meals prepared daily.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b050b-6643cc40" data-w-id="5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b050b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does a connected corporate fridge work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The operation of a connected fridge is very simple:<br></div>
              <ol role="list" class="list">
                <li>Diners scan their e-wallet, bank card or dematerialized meal ticket,</li>
                <li>He opens the fridge and selects his meal (starter, main course, dessert, drink),</li>
                <li>He closes the fridge, finalizing the purchase.</li>
              </ol>
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Every morning, the connected fridge is stocked with fresh produce.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b0516-6643cc40" data-w-id="5cd78bbd-ba44-ca6a-9b79-704d469b0516" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you install a connected fridge in your company?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
